    'The admin/system PIN protects factory/debug/admin settings (AdminSettingActivity, NewDebug*, RechargeDebug, region/domain switch, Samba/system options). A fixed backup PIN valid on every robot bypasses any customer-chosen admin PIN; PINs are also written to the application log via KLogCommon (a log directory /sdcard/keenon/slog is referenced by DiskCleanUpProcessor and a KR_LOG_UPLOAD cloud command exists; the exact log sink path is INFERRED). Cloud command ROBOT_APP_PWD_RESET_WEB and SCREEN_UNLOCK exist.',
    impact='Local privilege escalation to admin/debug functions by anyone who knows the (fleet-wide) backup PIN; PIN disclosure through logs.',
