    'Effective exported components (targetSdk 28, intent-filter without exported attr): SetupActivity (LAUNCHER + VIEW deep link supsetkeenon://supsetandroid.com, BROWSABLE), ApkInstallReceiver (PACKAGE_REPLACED; guarded by own-package check, JADX), androidx.test BootstrapActivity/EmptyActivity/EmptyFloatingActivity. Explicitly non-exported: NetService, HeartService, UpdateService, AlarmReceiver, BootReceiver, InstallResultReceiver, ReStartActivity, FileProvider, others. Dynamic receivers (BusinessInitializer.initSystemReceiver, DomainManager, UpgradeBroadcastReceiver, ...) listen for com.keenon.action.MAPPING_START/STOP/HEART_BRAT, DISCONNECT_ROBOT, hall.STATE_ARMREST_C40, DOMAIN_ISO_CHANGED, UPGRADE_INFO_CHANGED, android.peanut.action.exit_system/MAPPING_RESTART_ROS (registration flags/permissions not decompiled).',
